OL,3,GNEWSAStreet with 193 reports of
OL,4,Afly-tipping in CCTV bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a street targeted by
OL,7,Ffly-tippers say the problem is making
OL,8,Ftheir lives miserable.
OL,10,FA report for Hull City Council showed
OL,11,Fthere were 193 reported incidents of
OL,12,Fdumped rubbish on Reynoldson Street
OL,13,Fbetween January and June this year.
OL,15,FHeidi Wass, 58, said: "It's constant. I
OL,16,Fget stuff dumped outside my back gate,
OL,17,Fsometimes so much that I can't get out
OL,18,Fof the property ` and that's my fire
OL,19,Fexit."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
